rwxr-xr-x@   7 mattbillock  staff    224 Jan 14 23:40 whimsical-agent-names\\n", "stderr": ""}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UCL7PgJEWVZq9sBd27uA9s', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# UI Theming System - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\nThis project implements a comprehensive UI theming system with multiple pre-built themes and custom theme creation capabilities.\n\n## Milestone 1: Core Theming Infrastructure (Week 1-2)\n**Objective**: Establish the foundation for the theming system with basic theme switching capabilities.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- CSS custom properties architecture\n- React theme context and provider\n- Basic theme hook implementation\n- Theme data model and validation\n- Local storage persistence\n- Basic theme loading/switching functionality\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Theme context can be consumed by any component\n- CSS custom properties update dynamically when theme changes\n- Theme preferences persist across browser sessions\n- Theme data validation prevents invalid configurations\n- No visual flash during theme switching\n\n**Dependencies**: None\n\n## Milestone 2: Pre-built Themes and Theme Selector (Week 3)\n**Objective**: Implement pre-built themes and user interface for theme selection.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Light, dark, and high contrast themes\n- Theme selector component (dropdown/gallery)\n- Theme preview functionality\n- Component integration with theming system\n- Accessibility compliance validation\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- All three pre-built themes are fully functional\n- Theme selector provides clear visual preview\n- All UI components properly respond to theme changes\n- WCAG 2.1 AA contrast requirements are met\n- Keyboard navigation works for theme selection\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 (core infrastructure)\n\n## Milestone 3: Custom Theme Creation and Editor (Week 4-5)\n**Objective**: Enable users to create, edit, and manage custom themes.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Theme editor interface\n- Color picker component\n- Typography and spacing controls\n- Real-time theme preview\n- Custom theme save/load functionality\n- Theme export/import (JSON)\n- Theme reset functionality\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Users can customize all theme properties\n- Real-time preview shows changes immediately\n- Custom themes can be saved and reloaded\n- Theme export/import works with valid JSON\n- Reset functionality restores original themes\n- Theme editor is accessible and intuitive\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 2 (theme selector and base themes)\n\n## Milestone 4: Backend Integration and User Preferences (Week 6)\n**Objective**: Integrate with backend for theme persistence and user preference management.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Theme API endpoints (save, load, delete themes)\n- User preference storage integration\n- Theme synchronization across devices\n- Server-side theme validation\n- Rate limiting and security measures\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Custom themes persist across devices for logged-in users\n- API endpoints handle theme CRUD operations\n- Server validates theme data for security\n- Rate limiting prevents abuse\n- Theme sync works reliably\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 3 (custom theme creation), User authentication system\n\n## Milestone 5: Performance Optimization and Testing (Week 7)\n**Objective**: Optimize performance and ensure comprehensive test coverage.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Performance optimizations for theme switching\n- Comprehensive test suite (unit, integration, accessibility)\n- Browser compatibility testing\n- Performance benchmarking\n- Documentation and user guides\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Theme switching occurs within 200ms\n- All tests pass including accessibility tests\n- Compatible with target browsers\n- Documentation is complete and accurate\n- No memory leaks or performance regressions\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 4 (complete system)\n\n## Success Metrics\n- **Performance**: Theme switching < 200ms, no layout shift\n- **Accessibility**: All themes pass WCAG 2.1 AA standards\n- **User Experience**: Intuitive theme selection and creation\n- **Compatibility**: Works across all target browsers\n- **Test Coverage**: >90% code coverage with passing accessibility tests\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n- **CSS Custom Property Support**: Graceful degradation for older browsers\n- **Performance Impact**: Regular performance monitoring during development\n- **Accessibility Compliance**: Automated and manual accessibility testing\n- **User Experience**: User testing and feedback integration\n\n## Resource Requirements\n- **Frontend Developer**: React, CSS-in-JS, accessibility expertise\n- **Backend Developer**: Python/FastAPI, API design\n- **UI/UX Designer**: Theme design, accessibility consultation\n- **QA Engineer**: Testing, accessibility validation'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UCL7PgJEWVZq9sBd27uA9s', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260117_005035.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260117_005035.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RUcQz7egbDpbrvnCwibvUG', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'project_name': 'UI Theming System'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01RUcQz7egbDpbrvnCwibvUG', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": null}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Mh3x41AjSxG3UqYad8Hd43', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Mh3x41AjSxG3UqYad8Hd43', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# UI Theming System - Architecture Proposal\\n\\n## A. Architecture Overview\\n\\n### Architectural Pattern: Modular Frontend with Backend Support\\n- **Pattern**: Micro-frontend architecture with centralized theme management\\n- **Rationale**: Provides flexibility, scalability, and clear separation of concerns\\n- **Key Principle**: Decoupled theme system that can be easily integrated and extended\\n\\n## B. Tech Stack\\n\\n### Frontend\\n- **Framework**: React 18\\n- **Styling**: Styled-Components (CSS-in-JS)\\n- **State Management**: React Context API + Custom Theme Hook\\n- **Reasons**: \\n  - Excellent performance\\n  - Dynamic styling capabilities\\n  - Strong typing support\\n  - Easy theme variable management\\n\\n### Backend\\n- **Language**: Python\\n- **Framework**: FastAPI\\n- **Database**: PostgreSQL for user theme storage\\n- **Reasons**:\\n  - Fast performance\\n  - Easy API development\\n  - Strong typing with Pydantic\\n  - Robust ORM capabilities\\n\\n### Additional Tools\\n- **State Persistence**: Local Storage + Server-side storage\\n- **Validation**: Joi/Zod for schema validation\\n- **Testing**: Jest (frontend), Pytest (backend)\\n- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions\\n\\n## C. System Components\\n\\n### 1. Theme Provider\\n- **Responsibility**: Global theme state management\\n- **Key Functions**:\\n  - Load initial theme\\n  - Broadcast theme changes\\n  - Validate theme data\\n  - Manage theme persistence\\n\\n### 2. Theme Editor\\n- **Responsibility**: User interface for theme customization\\n- **Key Features**:\\n  - Color picker\\n  - Typography controls\\n  - Live preview\\n  - Export/Import functionality\\n\\n### 3. Theme API Service\\n- **Responsibility**: Backend theme management\\n- **Endpoints**:\\n  - GET /themes (retrieve available themes)\\n  - POST /themes (save custom theme)\\n  - PUT /themes/:id (update theme)\\n  - DELETE /themes/:id (remove custom theme)\\n\\n### 4. Theme Validation Service\\n- **Responsibility**: Ensure theme data integrity\\n- **Checks**:\\n  - Color contrast ratios\\n  - CSS property validation\\n  - Accessibility compliance\\n\\n## D. File/Directory Structure\\n\\n```\\nui-theming-system/\\n\\u2502\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 frontend/\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 src/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 components/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 ThemeProvider/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 ThemeEditor/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 hooks/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 useTheme.ts\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 services/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 themeService.ts\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 utils/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502       \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 themeValidation.ts\\n\\u2502   \\u2502\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 backend/\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 app/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 models/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 theme.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 services/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 theme_service.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 routes/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 theme_routes.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 validators/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502       \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 theme_validator.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502\\n\\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 shared/\\n    \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 theme-schema.json\\n```\\n\\n## E. Data Model\\n\\n### Theme Schema\\n```typescript\\ninterface Theme {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  colors: {\\n    primary: string;\\n    secondary: string;\\n    background: string;\\n    text: string;\\n  };\\n  typography: {\\n    fontFamily: string;\\n    fontSize: number;\\n    lineHeight: number;\\n  };\\n  spacing: {\\n    base: number;\\n    scale: number;\\n  };\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## F. API Design\\n\\n### Theme Endpoints\\n- `GET /themes` - List available themes\\n- `POST /themes` - Create custom theme\\n- `GET /themes/:id` - Retrieve specific theme\\n- `PUT /themes/:id` - Update theme\\n- `DELETE /themes/:id` - Delete theme\\n\\n## G. Deployment Strategy\\n\\n### Frontend\\n- Static hosting (Netlify/Vercel)\\n- CDN distribution\\n- Docker containerization\\n\\n### Backend\\n- Containerized deployment\\n- Kubernetes for scaling\\n- Database migrations with Alembic\\n\\n## H. Testing Strategy\\n\\n### Frontend\\n- Unit Tests: Component rendering\\n- Integration Tests: Theme switching\\n- Accessibility Tests: Color contrast\\n- Performance Tests: Theme load time\\n\\n### Backend\\n- Unit Tests: Theme validation\\n- Integration Tests: API endpoints\\n- Security Tests: Input sanitization\\n\\n## I. Alternatives Considered\\n\\n### CSS Modules vs Styled-Components\\n- **Styled-Components Chosen**\\n  - Pro: Dynamic styling\\n  - Pro: Easier theme management\\n  - Con: Slight performance overhead\\n\\n### Redux vs Context API\\n- **Context API Chosen**\\n  - Pro: Lightweight\\n  - Pro: Built-in React solution\\n  - Con: Less powerful for complex state\\n\\n## J. Risks and Mitigations\\n\\n1. **Performance Overhead**\\n   - Mitigation: Lazy loading of themes\\n   - Mitigation: Minimal CSS variable usage\\n\\n2. **Browser Compatibility**\\n   - Mitigation: Polyfills for older browsers\\n   - Mitigation: Graceful degradation\\n\\n3. **Accessibility Challenges**\\n   - Mitigation: Automated contrast checking\\n   - Mitigation: WCAG 2.1 compliance tests\\n\\n## K. Open Questions\\n\\n1. How many pre-built themes should be included initially?\\n2. What is the acceptable performance budget for theme switching?\\n3. Should we support custom font uploads?\\n\\n## Conclusion\\n\\nThis architecture provides a flexible, performant, and extensible UI theming system that meets all specified requirements while maintaining a clean, modular design."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_016ptytn5JYUB7zM63oUS7Pz', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/backend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Core Theming Infrastructure - Establish the foundation for the theming system with basic theme switching capabilities. Deliverables include theme data model and validation, theme API endpoints, theme persistence, and server-side theme validation.', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_016ptytn5JYUB7zM63oUS7Pz', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "tasks_identified": 13, "task_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md", "dependencies": [{"task": "1.2", "depends_on": ["1.1"]}, {"task": "1.3", "depends_on": ["1.2"]}, {"task": "2.2", "depends_on": ["2.1"]}, {"task": "2.3", "depends_on": ["2.2"]}, {"task": "3.1", "depends_on": ["1.2", "2.1"]}, {"task": "3.2", "depends_on": ["3.1", "2.3"]}, {"task": "4.1", "depends_on": ["3.2"]}, {"task": "4.2", "depends_on": ["3.2"]}, {"task": "4.3", "depends_on": ["4.1", "4.2", "1.1"]}, {"task": "5.1", "depends_on": 