{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 12:56:45", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-62035113-c5a0-4704-8ee8-155d3c6013d1', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 50, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': "Self-Improvement Task: Update model configuration for Test Coordinator\n\n**Recommendation:** Cost optimization: Test Coordinator consistently succeeds\n**Description:** Agent Test Coordinator has 97.89% success rate. Consider using a cheaper/faster model to reduce costs.\n\n**Required Change:**\nUpdate the agent definition file for Test Coordinator to use the 'sonnet' model.\nThe model preference is in the ## Model Preference section of the agent's markdown file.\n\nAfter making the change:\n1. Verify the syntax is correct\n2. Update any related configuration if needed\n3. Report the changes made"}], 'model': 'claude-3-haiku-20240307', 'system': 'You are a title generator. Generate a concise 5-10 word title that summarizes the main task or goal in the user\'s prompt.\n\nRules:\n- Return ONLY the title, nothing else\n- No quotes, periods, or other punctuation\n- Use action verbs when possible (Build, Create, Fix, Add, Implement)\n- Be specific but brief\n- If the prompt is about code, mention the technology/language if relevant\n\nExamples:\n- "Build user authentication with JWT tokens"\n- "Fix pagination bug in product listing"\n- "Add dark mode toggle to settings page"\n- "Implement real-time chat with WebSockets"\n- "Create REST API for user management"\n'}}"}
