ject ID**: b2d80e17  \n**Project Name**: TDD Coordinator Model Update  \n**Date**: 2026-01-17  \n**Executive Director**: System\n\n## Task Summary\nSelf-improvement initiative to update TDD Coordinator model configuration from claude-3-5-haiku-20241022 to claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929 for an expected 50% success rate improvement.\n\n## Current Status: COMPLETE ✅\n\n### Investigation Results\n\n**TDD Coordinator Configuration Analysis:**\n- **File Location**: `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/leadership/tdd_coordinator.md`\n- **Current Model Preference**: `sonnet` ✅\n- **Previous Configuration**: Found backup at `tdd_coordinator.md.pre_improvement` with model preference: `haiku`\n\n### Findings\n\n1. **Already Implemented**: The TDD Coordinator model preference has already been updated from `haiku` to `sonnet`\n2. **Configuration Verified**: Current configuration shows `## Model Preference\\nsonnet` \n3. **Backup Available**: Previous configuration preserved in `.pre_improvement` file\n4. **Syntax Validation**: Configuration syntax is correct and follows expected format\n\n### Git History Verification\nRecent commits show related model updates across the ensemble system, indicating ongoing self-improvement initiatives.\n\n## Deliverables\n\n✅ **Verification Complete**: TDD Coordinator model configuration validated  \n✅ **Syntax Check**: Configuration syntax confirmed correct  \n✅ **Documentation**: Status report created documenting findings\n\n## Conclusion\n\nThe requested model update for TDD Coordinator from claude-3-5-haiku-20241022 to claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929 has already been implemented. The agent definition file correctly shows model preference as 'sonnet', and the previous configuration has been preserved as a backup.\n\n**No further action required** - the self-improvement recommendation has been successfully applied.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- Monitor TDD Coordinator performance with the new sonnet model\n- Validate expected 50% success rate