/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/coordinators/frontend_coordinator.md`\\n   - Responsibility: Define agent model preference and capabilities\\n   - Change: Update model from \'haiku\' to \'sonnet\'\\n\\n2. **Configuration Loader**\\n   - Existing system that reads markdown configuration\\n   - Must support \'sonnet\' model identifier\\n   - No modifications required to loader itself\\n\\n## D) File/Directory Structure\\n```\\nensemble/\\n\\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 coordinators/\\n    \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 frontend_coordinator.md  # Target file for update\\n```\\n\\n## E) Data Model\\n- **Model Preference**: Simple string value\\n- **Current State**: `haiku`\\n- **Target State**: `sonnet`\\n\\n## F) Update Strategy\\n1. Direct text replacement in markdown file\\n2. Preserve all existing formatting\\n3. Validate file syntax post-update\\n\\n## G) Deployment Strategy\\n- Manual update of configuration file\\n- No runtime or system-level deployments required\\n- Version control commit with descriptive message\\n\\n## H) Testing Strategy\\n1. **Syntax Validation**\\n   - Verify markdown structure remains intact\\n   - Confirm no unintended formatting changes\\n\\n2. **Configuration Validation**\\n   - Verify \'sonnet\' model can be correctly read\\n   - Confirm no changes to other configuration sections\\n\\n## I) Alternatives Considered\\n1. Complete agent redefinition (Rejected: Unnecessarily complex)\\n2. Phased model transition (Rejected: Introduces complexity)\\n3. Direct text replacement (Chosen: Minimal risk, direct approach)\\n\\n## J) Risks and Mitigations\\n- **Risk**: Model compatibility issues\\n  - **Mitigation**: Verify \'sonnet\' model\'s compatibility beforehand\\n- **Risk**: Unintended configuration changes\\n  - **Mitigation**: Strict syntax validation, manual review\\n\\n## K) Open Questions\\n- Confirm \'sonnet\' model\'s pricing and performance characteristics\\n- Validate cost savings expectation\\n\\n## Performance Impact Analysis\\n- Current Success Rate: 98.41%\\n- Expected Change: Minimal to no performance deviation\\n- Primary Goal: Cost optimization\\n\\n## Recommendation\\nProceed with the proposed update, replacing \'haiku\' with \'sonnet\' in the Frontend Coordinator\'s configuration file."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01EqReUAgLWwmkmEMeTKJCtD', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01EqReUAgLWwmkmEMeTKJCtD', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Frontend Coordinator Model Update - Requirements\\n\\n## Vision\\nUpdate the Frontend Coordinator agent definition to use the \'sonnet\' model instead of the current \'haiku\' model for cost optimization, while maintaining the agent\'s excellent performance (98.41% success rate).\\n\\n## Objectives\\n1. **Primary**: Change model preference from \'haiku\' to \'sonnet\' in Frontend Coordinator definition\\n2. **Verification**: Ensure syntax correctness and proper configuration\\n3. **Validation**: Confirm no breaking changes to agent functionality\\n4. **Documentation**: Record the change and rationale\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n### In Scope\\n- Modify the \\"## Model Preference\\" section in `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/coordinators/frontend_coordinator.md`\\n- Update model preference from \\"haiku\\" to \\"sonnet\\"\\n- Verify file syntax and structure integrity\\n- Validate related configuration consistency\\n\\n### Out of Scope\\n- Changes to other agent definitions\\n- Modifications to agent behavior or capabilities\\n- Updates to runtime system or configuration loading\\n- Testing the model change in live environment\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n### Functional Requirements\\n- **FR-1**: Model preference must be changed from \\"haiku\\" to \\"sonnet\\"\\n- **FR-2**: All other sections of the agent definition must remain unchanged\\n- **FR-3**: File must maintain valid markdown structure\\n- **FR-4**: Agent capabilities and permissions must remain identical\\n\\n### Non-Functional Requirements\\n- **NFR-1**: Change must be backward compatible with current configuration system\\n- **NFR-2**: No impact on agent\'s existing success rate or performance characteristics\\n- **NFR-3**: Change must be easily reversible if needed\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- \\u2705 Frontend Coordinator definition file updated with \\"sonnet\\" model preference\\n- \\u2705 File syntax validation passes\\n- \\u2705 All other configuration sections preserved exactly\\n- \\u2705 Change committed to version control with descriptive message\\n\\n## Constraints\\n- Must preserve exact formatting and structure of existing file\\n- Cannot modify agent permissions, tools, or capabilities\\n- Must maintain consistency with other model preference formats in the system\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- The \'sonnet\' model is available and compatible with the Frontend Coordinator\'s role\\n- The configuration loading system supports the \'sonnet\' model identifier\\n- Cost optimization is the primary driver for this change\\n- No behavioral changes are expected from the model switch\\n\\n## Technical Details\\n- **Target File**: `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/coordinators/frontend_coordinator.md`\\n- **Section to Update**: `## Model Preference`\\n- **Current Value**: `haiku`\\n- **New Value**: `sonnet`\\n- **Configuration Format**: Simple text value under the Model Preference heading\\n\\n## Rationale\\nThe Frontend Coordinator has demonstrated exceptional performance with a 98.41% success rate, indicating that it can maintain effectiveness with a more cost-efficient model. The \'sonnet\' model provides a balance of capability and cost that aligns with optimization goals while preserving the agent\'s proven effectiveness."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 't