urrent Value**: `haiku`\\n- **New Value**: `sonnet`\\n- **Configuration Format**: Simple text value under the Model Preference heading\\n\\n## Rationale\\nThe Frontend Coordinator has demonstrated exceptional performance with a 98.41% success rate, indicating that it can maintain effectiveness with a more cost-efficient model. The \'sonnet\' model provides a balance of capability and cost that aligns with optimization goals while preserving the agent\'s proven effectiveness."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01THJ4AFKuoMYLNpZ4VhB9bJ', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'TDD Coordinator Model Update', 'description': "Update Frontend Coordinator model from 'haiku' to 'sonnet' for cost optimization"}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01THJ4AFKuoMYLNpZ4VhB9bJ', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "8e7daf96", "message": "Created project: TDD Coordinator Model Update", "summary": {"project_id": "8e7daf96", "project_name": "TDD Coordinator Model Update", "description": "Update Frontend Coordinator model from \'haiku\' to \'sonnet\' for cost optimization", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-17T12:57:13.830052", "updated_at": "2026-01-17T12:57:13.830052", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-17T12:57:13.830052", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'TDD Coordinator Model Update\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UKqUSX5ALPksPpxExZnSP1', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattb