{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 12:58:03", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-fc19bae3-56ef-48c7-95e3-67d5b7c0dcda', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "CONTINUATION OF PREVIOUS TASK\\n\\n## Original Task\\nSelf-Improvement Task: Update model configuration for Development Manager\\n\\n**Recommendation:** Model optimization for Development Manager\\n**Description:** Consider using claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929 instead of claude-3-5-haiku-20241022. Expected improvement: +72.1% success rate\\n\\n**Required Change:**\\nUpdate the agent definition file for Development Manager to use the \'sonnet\' model.\\nThe model preference is in the ## Model Preference section of the agent\'s markdown file.\\n\\nAfter making the change:\\n1. Verify the syntax is correct\\n2. Update any related configuration if needed\\n3. Report the changes made\\n\\n## Previous Question\\nCould you provide the exact path and contents of the Development Manager agent configuration file? The system could not locate the file at /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/leadership/development_manager.md\\n\\n## User\'s Answer\\nScan the codebase for it, or ask your supervisor.\\n\\n## Instructions\\nThe user has answered your question above. Please continue with implementation based on their clarification. Do not ask the same question again - proceed with the approach based on their answer.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use