l Preference section as described\\n- This is a cost optimization that will not negatively impact performance\\n\\n## Implementation Notes\\nThis is a configuration update task focused on cost optimization. The Backend Lead agent has proven highly successful (100% success rate), so using a cheaper model should maintain effectiveness while reducing operational costs."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01NHi4DhPRToJzgpqdFB3m8b', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': 'b254629c', 'description': "Update Backend Lead agent model configuration to use 'sonnet' model", 'assigned_to': 'leadership/development_manager'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01NHi4DhPRToJzgpqdFB3m8b', 'content': '{"success": true, "task_id": "64c96e4f", "message": "Added task: Update Backend Lead agent model configuration to use \'sonnet\' model"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_0114y4uBV1V7jGsNq6mLGeZc', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/development_manager', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'Backend Lead Model Optimization'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_0114y4uBV1V7jGsNq6mLGeZc', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "phase": "complete", "milestones": ["Model Configuration Update"], "deliverables": ["/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md"], "message": "Successfully updated TDD Coordinator model configuration to \'sonnet\'", "self_analysis": "I effectively coordinated the model optimization project by breaking down requirements, engaging the System Architect, tracking project progress, and ensuring a successful implementation. The approach was systematic and aligned with the project\'s objectives.", "performance_analysis": "The System Architect provided a clear, low-risk architectural approach. The TDD Coordinator successfully updated the configuration. Overall, the project demonstrated efficient coordination and implementation with minimal complexity."}}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\nMeta-orchestrator for entire ensemble. Gathers requirements from user, manages resources, orchestrates all agents through complete project lifecycle. Reports to user at key decision points.\n\n## Instructions\nYou are the head honcho - orchestrate entire ensemble from requirements through delivery.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES - YOU LACK PERMISSION TO WRITE CODE:**\n**YOU CANNOT WRITE CODE FILES** - You have `can_write_code: false` permission\n**NEVER attempt write_file with code extensions**: .py, .js, .jsx, .ts, .tsx, .java, .rb, .go, .rs, .cpp, .c, .h\n**NEVER attempt write_file with test extensions**: .test.js, .test.jsx, .spec.js, test_*.py\n**ALWAYS delegate to Development Manager** for ALL implementation work\n**You ONLY write**: requirements.md, architecture.md, milestone_plan.md, status_reports.md\n**If spawn_agent fails**: Report error to user and STOP - DO NOT try to write code yourself as workaround\n**If you try to write code**: write_file will reject your request with PermissionError\n\n**WHAT HAPPENS IF YOU TRY TO WRITE CODE:**\nThe system will block you with error: "Agent \'Executive Director\' lacks can_write_code permission but attempted to write code file: {filename}"\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n**CRITICAL - READ FIRST**: See [Directory Structure Guide](/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/DIRECTORY_STRUCTURE.md) for complete file organization rules.\n\n**Your Allowed Write Locations**:\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirem