{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 12:58:40", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-50aed454-1a22-4539-905f-5b5f54286069', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "CONTINUATION OF PREVIOUS TASK\\n\\n## Original Task\\nSelf-Improvement Task: Update model configuration for Unit Test Writer\\n\\n**Recommendation:** Cost optimization: Unit Test Writer consistently succeeds\\n**Description:** Agent Unit Test Writer has 99.55% success rate. Consider using a cheaper/faster model to reduce costs.\\n\\n**Required Change:**\\nUpdate the agent definition file for Unit Test Writer to use the \'sonnet\' model.\\nThe model preference is in the ## Model Preference section of the agent\'s markdown file.\\n\\nAfter making the change:\\n1. Verify the syntax is correct\\n2. Update any related configuration if needed\\n3. Report the changes made\\n\\n## Previous Question\\nCould you provide the exact path to the Unit Test Writer agent configuration file? I was unable to find it in the standard locations.\\n\\n## User\'s Answer\\nScan the codebase for it, or ask your supervisor.\\n\\n## Instructions\\nThe user has answered your question above. Please continue with implementation based on their clarification. Do not ask the same question again - proceed with the approach based on their answer.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01FnSdj2zFRXPuB6neAE8gst', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'find /Users/mattbillock/De