{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 12:59:23", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-0e492096-c952-4e2f-9a85-808808264fbc', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Self-Improvement Task: Update model configuration for TDD Coordinator\\n\\n**Recommendation:** Cost optimization: TDD Coordinator consistently succeeds\\n**Description:** Agent TDD Coordinator has 95.24% success rate. Consider using a cheaper/faster model to reduce costs.\\n\\n**Required Change:**\\nUpdate the agent definition file for TDD Coordinator to use the \'sonnet\' model.\\nThe model preference is in the ## Model Preference section of the agent\'s markdown file.\\n\\nAfter making the change:\\n1. Verify the syntax is correct\\n2. Update any related configuration if needed\\n3. Report the changes made",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01B5ro8zuJxKf2denUxXBnGD', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'TDD Coordinator Model Update', 'description': "Self-improvement task: Update TDD Coordinator to use 'sonnet' model for cost optimization due to high success rate (95.24%)"}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01B5ro8zuJxKf2denUxXBnGD', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "11a1c83b", "message": "Created project: TDD Coordinator Model Update", "summary": {"project_id": "11a1c83b", "project_name": "TDD Coordinator Model Update", "description": "Self